<title>UK: Western Australia Treasury sets A$200 mln Eurobond.</title>
<headline>Western Australia Treasury sets A$200 mln Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Nomura International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WESTERN AUSTRALIA TREASURY CORP</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  TREASURER OF THE STATE OF WESTERN AUSTRALIA</p>
<p> AMT	A$200 MLN   COUPON     6.00	MATURITY    21.JAN.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.138   PAY DATE    21.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.375     LISTING    NONE	PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AA+   DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS US/UK/AU</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  AUSTRALIA</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.375     SELL CONC  1.00</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
